10465920075334/0001104659-20-075334-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2019-02-11","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1749723/000114036119002886/0001140361-19-002886-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2019-02-11","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1749723/000114036119002880/0001140361-19-002880-index.htm","tone":"warn"}],"summary":{"sentences":["New Fortress Energy Inc. files with the SEC under \"Natural Gas Distribution\", based in NY, and has been publicly reporting for 7 years.","It reported $1.0bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, down 51.9% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of -7.8%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($137.0m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $137.0m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1749723/000174972326000062/0001749723-26-000062-index.htm","accession":"0001749723-26-000062"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 51.9% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1749723/000174972326000062/0001749723-26-000062-index.htm","accession":"0001749723-26-000062"},{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 21.4% to -7.8% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001749723"},{"text":"Gross margin is only -7.8%, so scale has to be enormous before anything reaches the bottom line.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001749723"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-121.7% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1749723/000174972326000062/0001749723-26-000062-index.htm","accession":"0001749723-26-000062"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $212.9m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1749723/000174972326000062/0001749723-26-000062-index.htm","accession":"0001749723-26-000062"},{"text":"Shareholders' equity is negative (-$180.2m) - liabilities exceed assets on the balance sheet.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1749723/000174972326000062/0001749723-26-000062-index.htm","accession":"0001749723-26-000062"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.1% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1749723/000174972326000103/0001749723-26-000103-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 0.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.0,"consecutive":2,"current":-0.078,"current_display":"-7.8%","threshold_display":"0.0%","fired":true,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -67.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenu